ct way to check is number "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"i"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" is prime."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Another simple solution of this problem is to conside the fact that restrictions are no more than 50. It is possible to find all pairs "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" by hands and write solution formed by series of cases like this:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"if (n==2 && m==3) return \"YES\";"},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" else if (n==3 && m==5) return \"YES\"; "},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" else ... "},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" else if (n==43 && m==47) return \"YES\"; "},{"kind":"line_break"},{"kind":"text","text":" else return \"NO\";"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This solution gets \"accepted\" too. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" "}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Complexity may be various because of diffenent realizations and is in range from "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"(1) to "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"O"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"n"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":" + "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"m"}],"kind":"emphasis"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If you are interested in why your soluti